https://bugs.mysql.com/bug.php?id=120735&thanks=4    not a bug

核心不是投影表达式本身，投影恒为 NULL；真正差异在 WHERE c0 IN (EXISTS(SELECT 1), -(CAST(NULL AS SIGNED))) 的过滤行数。
最小复现案例

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_mysql620_17;
CREATE DATABASE repro_mysql620_17;
USE repro_mysql620_17;

SET SESSION sql_mode =
  'ONLY_FULL_GROUP_BY,STRICT_TRANS_TABLES,NO_ZERO_IN_DATE,NO_ZERO_DATE,ERROR_FOR_DIVISION_BY_ZERO,NO_ENGINE_SUBSTITUTION';

SET SESSION time_zone = '+00:00';

CREATE TABLE s (
  vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
  c0 DECIMAL(65,30) NULL,
  KEY idx_c0(c0 DESC)
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

INSERT INTO s(c0) VALUES
  (0), (0),
  (1), (1), (1), (1),
  (2), (NULL), (3);

CREATE TABLE l (
  vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,
  c0 DECIMAL(65,30) NULL
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

CREATE TABLE r (
  vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,
  c0 DECIMAL(65,30) NULL
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

INSERT INTO l SELECT vp_rowid, c0 FROM s;
INSERT INTO r SELECT vp_rowid, c0 FROM s;

ALTER TABLE r
  ADD CONSTRAINT fk_r_l
  FOREIGN KEY (vp_rowid) REFERENCES l(vp_rowid);

SELECT
  GREATEST(
    EXISTS (SELECT 1 WHERE FALSE),
    CASE 'T\t'
      WHEN 0.48091024131969884 THEN s.vp_rowid
      ELSE NULL
    END
  ) AS ref0
FROM s
WHERE c0 IN (EXISTS (SELECT 1), -(CAST(NULL AS SIGNED)))
ORDER BY vp_rowid
LIMIT 6;

SELECT
  GREATEST(
    EXISTS (SELECT 1 WHERE FALSE),
    CASE 'T\t'
      WHEN 0.48091024131969884 THEN d.vp_rowid
      ELSE NULL
    END
  ) AS ref0
FROM (
  WITH
  lcte AS (
    SELECT
      ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY vp_rowid) AS rn,
      vp_rowid,
      c0
    FROM l
  ),
  rcte AS (
    SELECT
      ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY vp_rowid) AS rn,
      vp_rowid,
      c0
    FROM r
  )
  SELECT
    lcte.vp_rowid,
    lcte.c0
  FROM lcte
  JOIN rcte ON lcte.rn = rcte.rn
) AS d
WHERE c0 IN (EXISTS (SELECT 1), -(CAST(NULL AS SIGNED)))
ORDER BY vp_rowid
LIMIT 6;


Single query：返回 4 行
实测结果：
+------+
| ref0 |
+------+
| NULL |
| NULL |
| NULL |
| NULL |
+------+
Split query：保留 SQLancer ROW_NUMBER_ALIGNMENT，返回 6 行
实测结果：
+------+
| ref0 |
+------+
| NULL |
| NULL |
| NULL |
| NULL |
| NULL |
| NULL |
+------+

single_count = 4
split_count  = 6
执行计划：Single

关键计划：
-> Limit: 6 row(s)
    -> Sort: s.vp_rowid
        -> Filter: (s.c0 in (exists(select #3), <cache>(-(cast(NULL as signed)))))
            -> Covering index range scan on s using idx_c0 over
               (c0 = 1.000000000000000000000000000000)
重点是这里：
Covering index range scan on s using idx_c0 over (c0 = 1...)
Single 查询只走了 c0 = 1 的索引范围，所以只返回 4 行。
执行计划：Split

关键计划：
-> Limit: 6 row(s)
    -> Nested loop inner join
        -> Sort: vp_rowid
            -> Filter: (lcte.c0 in (exists(select #6), <cache>(-(cast(NULL as signed)))))
                -> Table scan on lcte
                    -> Materialize CTE lcte
                        -> Window aggregate: row_number() OVER (ORDER BY l.vp_rowid)
                            -> Sort: l.vp_rowid
                                -> Table scan on l
        -> Index lookup on rcte using <auto_key0> (rn = lcte.rn)
            -> Materialize CTE rcte
                -> Window aggregate: row_number() OVER (ORDER BY r.vp_rowid)
                    -> Sort: r.vp_rowid
                        -> Table scan on r
Split 查询物化 lcte/rcte 后，对 lcte 做表扫过滤，没有走 c0 = 1 的范围扫描，所以把 c0 = 0 的两行也返回了。
我还检查了逐行谓词结果：
SELECT
  vp_rowid,
  c0,
  c0 IN (EXISTS (SELECT 1), -(CAST(NULL AS SIGNED))) AS pred
FROM s
ORDER BY vp_rowid;
实测：
vp_rowid  c0    pred
1         0     1
2         0     1
3         1     1
4         1     1
5         1     1
6         1     1
7         2     0
8         NULL  NULL
9         3     0
所以按逐行求值，c0=0 和 c0=1 都满足谓词，总共应该是 6 行。Split 的表扫结果是 6 行；Single 的索引范围扫描只取 c0=1，漏掉了两个 c0=0。
结论

DECIMAL 列上的 IN 谓词
c0 IN (EXISTS(SELECT 1), -(CAST(NULL AS SIGNED)))

在直接基表查询中触发 idx_c0 范围扫描时，
优化器把范围错误收缩成 c0 = 1，
漏掉了逐行求值为 TRUE 的 c0 = 0。

VP 的 ROW_NUMBER_ALIGNMENT 重构物化 CTE 后改走表扫，
因此返回了 c0 = 0 和 c0 = 1 共 6 行。
